Indemnification and Hold Harmless: You agree to defend, indemnify, and hold harmless the Bot creator(s), developers, administrators, and contributors from and against any and all claims, damages, obligations, losses, liabilities, costs, or debt, and expenses (including but not limited to attorney's fees) arising from:

